aka46.com/images/14/d47/4c4b3fd8a89a8aa1dc7aea65074c0.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(スマホ変えたら色んな機能ついてて感動して手書きもしてみちゃった笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パープル秋メイクに挑戦しました🙈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラグーナミュージックフェスに出演させて頂きました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2年半ぶりで凄く懐かしい景色を観させていただいたり、夜景も綺麗で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何より久しぶりのフェスだったのでとっても楽しかったです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お越しくださった皆様"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます(๑♡ᴗ♡๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"汗だくー😶😶"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/images/14/d47/4c4b3fd8a89a8aa1dc7aea65074c0-01.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりにハーフアップにしたよん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/images/14/d47/4c4b3fd8a89a8aa1dc7aea65074c0-02.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここ2ヶ月くらいで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NetflixとU-NEXTで沢山ドラマをみました🙈🙈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10本はみたな😂😂超えてるぞ…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とまらないの💓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よくゆみこちゃんと天ちゃんと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドラマのお話をします😁😁😁"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{